#b#cff0099ff* Participation#nb#nc
* Siege: every Saturday 18:30 (Philippine time, GMT+8).
* Register at Frankie (Apply) any time before 18:30 (guild leader only).
 - Entry fee: 100,000,000 Penya. Every registered guild fights.
 - At least 2 guilds must register, or there is no siege.
 - Lineup (Entry at Frankie): up to 10 members, level 30 or higher.
* Schedule (Saturday)
 - 18:30  Applications close
 - 18:35  Enter the arena (3 minutes)
 - 18:38  Preparation (1 minute)
 - 18:39  Combat begins (30 minutes)
 - 19:09  Combat ends, everyone returns to Flaris
#b#cffff0000* Vagrants may enter to watch, but cannot fight.#nb#nc

#b#cff0099ff* Basic Rules#nb#nc
 - Combat lasts 30 minutes.
 - Your party is dissolved when you enter the arena.
 - Everyone in the arena gets the Assist buffs (level 7) automatically.
 - 5 members of each guild fight at a time; the rest wait in line.
 - A defeated fighter goes to the back of the line; the next one takes the seat.
 - Each fighter has 10 lives.
#b#cff0099ff* Staying away#nb#nc
 - A lineup member who is not in the arena (offline or on another map) loses 1 life every minute while combat runs.
 - If it is your turn and you are away, the next player takes the seat: you lose 1 life and go to the back of the line.
 - A fighter waiting to revive keeps their place.
 - With only 2 guilds left, every life lost this way gives the other guild 2 points (4 when its master is in the arena with lives left).

#b#cff0099ff* Winning#nb#nc
 - The guild with the most points wins. Ties: more lives left, then the lower average level of the fighters still alive.
 - Defeating an enemy: +2 points.
 - Bonus (they add up): +1 for an enemy you had not defeated before, +1 when the Guild Master makes the kill, +1 for defeating the Defender, +1 for defeating an enemy with no lives left, +1 for every life your fighters still have at the end.

#b#cff0099ff* Rewards#nb#nc
 - Every kill in the siege: 2 PVP Tokens at once.
 - After each siege, every fighter of the top 3 guilds gets PVP Tokens: 50 / 14 / 7 (1st / 2nd / 3rd guild).
 - Weekly prizes, Monday 00:00, for last week:
   Guild (most wins), top 5: 600 / 300 / 180 / 72 / 48 PVP Tokens into the guild bank
   Players (most points), top 10: 200 / 100 / 60 / 40 / 30 / 24 / 20 / 14 / 8 / 4 PVP Tokens
   Best of each class (Mercenary, Magician, Acrobat, Assist), top 10 each: 100 / 50 / 30 / 20 / 15 / 12 / 10 / 7 / 4 / 2 PVP Tokens
   MVP (most MVP awards), top 10: 300 / 150 / 90 / 60 / 45 / 36 / 30 / 21 / 12 / 6 PVP Tokens
   Player prizes come by mail.
 - Points rank the Players and class boards; the player with the most points in a siege is its MVP; the winning guild gets a win.
* Stay in the arena until the PVP Tokens are given out.
#b#cffff0000* A full inventory sends the PVP Tokens to your Mailbox.#nb#nc

#b#cff0099ff* Applying Fee#nb#nc
 - Cancel (Apply window at Frankie, before 18:30): 80% comes back to the guild leader (by mail if offline or the purse is full).
#b#cffff0000* Guilds that take part in the siege do not get their fee back.#nb#nc